      "rows": [
        {
          "key": "AC-1",
          "text": "AC-1 [ears] When a member shares a note and picks an expiry time, the system shall store that time on the new link.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-4, L-code-2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-2",
          "text": "AC-2 [ears] When someone opens a link after its expiry time, the system shall show that the link has expired and shall not return the note.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-3, A1",
            "answer A1: Q1 Q1.a Add a choice; links with no time never expire",
            "answer A1: Q2 Q2.a They never expire",
            "answer A1: Q3 Q3.a A page that says the link expired",
            "answer A1: Q4 Q4.a Either one ends the link; expiry is not behind the flag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-3",
          "text": "AC-3 [ears] While a link has no expiry time, the system shall keep it valid until it is revoked or its note is deleted.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-3, A1",
            "answer A1: Q1 Q1.a Add a choice; links with no time never expire",
            "answer A1: Q2 Q2.a They never expire",
            "answer A1: Q3 Q3.a A page that says the link expired",
            "answer A1: Q4 Q4.a Either one ends the link; expiry is not behind the flag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-4",
          "text": "AC-4 [ears] If the chosen expiry time is not in the future, the system shall refuse to create the link.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-5",
          "text": "AC-5 [ears] While a link is revoked or expired, the system shall not return its note.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-3, L-product-2, A1",
            "answer A1: Q1 Q1.a Add a choice; links with no time never expire",
            "answer A1: Q2 Q2.a They never expire",
            "answer A1: Q3 Q3.a A page that says the link expired",
            "answer A1: Q4 Q4.a Either one ends the link; expiry is not behind the flag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-6",
          "text": "AC-6 [ears] When the weekly digest is built, the system shall list the owner's links that expire within 7 days.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: A2",
            "answer A2: Q5 Q5.a Any editor",
            "answer A2: Q6 Q6.a The server clock, UTC, the instant is the end",
            "answer A2: Q7 other: Also tell the note's owner a week before a link expires, in the weekly digest email."
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-7",
          "text": "AC-7 [ears] If a link was created before this change, the system shall treat it as having no expiry time.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-3, A1",
            "answer A1: Q1 Q1.a Add a choice; links with no time never expire",
            "answer A1: Q2 Q2.a They never expire",
            "answer A1: Q3 Q3.a A page that says the link expired",
            "answer A1: Q4 Q4.a Either one ends the link; expiry is not behind the flag"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-8",
          "text": "AC-8 [ears] When an editor revokes a link, the system shall stop returning its note, as it does today.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-product-2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-9",
          "text": "AC-9 [ears] When the digest is built for a week with no changed note, the system shall send nothing.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-product-6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "AC-10",
          "text": "AC-10 [ears] If a viewer tries to create a link, the system shall refuse, as it does today.",
          "status": "failing",
          "lines": [
            "cites: L-code-2"
          ]
        }
      ]
